{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だにと遊んだよ!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNGGH7HBPVQ0GEDPCMD4RX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nお揃いのパーカーで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"DVDを見ながら、タコパをしたよ🐙"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNGHFCT9MBCJVT8HFDRF97","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nたこ焼きを頬張るだに。\n子供みたい👶"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNGJHXHJ6RYPENDR33EP68","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nだには、たこ焼きを作るの慣れてました。\nひっくり返すの上手だった〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通のたこ焼き以外にも、餅チーズキムチたこ焼き とかホットケーキミックスにチョコを入れたのを作ったりしたよ\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNGKJT3B33MYE5GC6XSQTB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n美味しかったな〜〜\nホットケーキミックスの方は、メープルシロップをかけたりバニラアイスを載せて食べたよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上出来でした。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNGMKBHB98TFMHR7C3H3BP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は、鍋パしたいな🍲\n寒いうちに。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。\n⊿長沢菜々香"}],"source":"archive"}